{"id":"estructura","lemma":"estructura","pos":"noun","rank":2591,"glosses":["structure"],"ipa":"/estɾuɡˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"estructuras"},"examples":[{"text":"La estructura no es segura.","en":"The structure isn't safe.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/59198","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"secure","l":"seguro"}]},{"text":"Los rascacielos son estructuras hermosas.","en":"Skyscrapers are beautiful structures.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"skyscraper"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"gorgeous","l":"hermoso"}]},{"text":"La estructura no es lo suficientemente fuerte como para soportar tanto peso.","en":"The structure isn't strong enough to support so much weight.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"sufficiently"},{"g":"strong"},null,null,{"g":"to bear"},{"g":"copy"},{"g":"weight"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"to"]]}]}